These commands help you correct mistakes.

git restore file.py	Discard unstaged changes
git restore --staged file.py	Unstage a file
git reset --soft HEAD~1	Undo last commit, keep changes staged
git reset --mixed HEAD~1	Undo last commit, keep changes unstaged
git reset --hard HEAD~1	Remove last commit and discard associated changes
git revert commit-id	Create a new commit that reverses another commit
git clean -n	Preview untracked files to delete
git clean -f	Delete untracked files
